  "content": "<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ES3EF9b_Ub8\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p>新增女僕任務：御劍術</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_c4fbd494-13c6-4215-9644-d08c291df31b.png\" width=\"504\" height=\"103\"></p><p>現在你的女僕會施展御劍術並跟隨你。劍的樣式取決於女僕主手的物品。</p><p>&nbsp;<strong>（支援裝甲師工作坊模型）</strong></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_135553a1-2725-45fc-bba1-c4c0291369c5.png\" width=\"507\" height=\"298\"></p><p>若周圍有敵人，女僕會發射三把劍來保護主人。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_772c9ad9-09fb-496d-bceb-1159701fe91c.png\" width=\"510\" height=\"254\"></p><p>當女僕受傷時，她會發射六把劍來保護自己。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_0c6034ad-2d97-47c8-ad48-b32e459cafd6.png\" width=\"512\" height=\"277\"></p><p>支援在地化模型女僕與原版基岩模型女僕。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1334387/description_e18358c7-6766-42e6-9c05-94b935e27f0b.png\" width=\"515\" height=\"283\"></p><p>你可以透過設定檔修改劍類物品或啟用劍的發光效果。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1334387/description_46ec3a45-74c8-43a4-b953-8ffeb68166e5.png\" width=\"515\" height=\"199\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>鳴謝：</strong></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/tartaricacid/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">TartaricAcid</a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/sagesse32/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">SAGESSE32</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
